Remove the fixed-MMIO display-reset driver, mutable production sysfs controls
and the incomplete presilicon HDCP validation interface.  The latter exposes
raw test machinery without a complete end-user content-protection contract;
mask its otherwise-unhandled timer interrupt after removing the implementation.

